{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## Controlled A/B confirms the diagnosis\n\nSame ticket, same acceptance criteria, same ticket snapshot, ~9 minutes apart. The only\nvariable was the tree.\n\n| Run | Tree read | Verdict |\n|---|---|---|\n| `transition_ticket` with no `ref` | server checkout HEAD `2e28d817a7e` | **FAIL — 5 unmet criteria** |\n| `verify_completion_start(ref=\"e21f3240cd0\")` | `e21f3240cd03bcc0ced9fceda0a824e51803e249` | **PASS**, signed |\n\nThe close then succeeded with `ref=\"e21f3240cd0\"` and minted a signed completion attestation:\n\n```json\n{\"from\":\"in_progress\",\"to\":\"closed\",\n \"completion_signature\":{\"signed\":true,\"cause\":\"signed\",\"error\":\"\"}}\n```\n\nNo force was used in either direction. The failing run was not a gate correctly refusing\nincomplete work — it was the gate reading a tree that has nothing to do with the ticket.\n\nThis rules out the competing explanations worth considering:\n\n- **Not a stale ticket snapshot.** The verifier's own guidance text blames a snapshot pinned\n  before a write lands. The passing run read the same ticket record and the same AC text.\n- **Not genuinely unmet criteria.** The criteria passed unchanged against the landed tree.\n- **Not a signing or attestation fault.** The passing run signed at\n  `verified_at_sha=e21f3240cd0...`, naming the tree in the durable record — which is precisely\n  the field AC1 asks the *failure* path to surface.\n\nNote the asymmetry that makes this expensive: the **passing** result reports\n`verified_at_sha`, so a success tells you which tree it read. The **failing** result reports\nno SHA at all. The run that most needs the tree named is the one that omits it."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793439627545281647,"uuid":"ecdeed84-a840-47c3-95c0-a1fff6a8d3dd"}